{
  "context": "Add one canonical team closeout operation and persist the current step and evidence before and after each external action. Fence new work first; adopt artifacts and secure accepted commits; settle evaluation; release claims; close subordinate Herdr workers and manager last; remove worktrees; then remove branches and temporary refs when reachability rules allow. Decision gate: any dirty, changed, protected, foreign, ambiguous, or live-in-use resource moves the team to waiting_user with exact remediation evidence; it is never silently skipped or force-deleted.",
  "description": "Implement one durable team closeout state machine that adopts artifacts, secures accepted code, settles review, releases claims, closes Bossmode-created Herdr workers, removes Bossmode-created worktrees, and deletes safe owned branches and retention refs. Closeout must be automatic, idempotent, resumable after a crash, and unable to report success while any owned resource is unresolved.",
  "legacy": {
    "anti_patterns": [
      {
        "dont": "Delete first and record success afterward without durable intent",
        "instead": "Persist retiring intent and evidence around every idempotent external call",
        "item_id": "bossmode-4-durable-team-closeout",
        "why": "A crash loses whether the action occurred"
      },
      {
        "dont": "Force cleanup to satisfy a zero-residual assertion",
        "instead": "Block completion until the unsafe condition is resolved or an explicit preservation disposition is approved",
        "item_id": "bossmode-4-durable-team-closeout",
        "why": "It can destroy valuable or foreign work"
      },
      {
        "dont": "Make cleanup an optional auto-retire flag",
        "instead": "Make safe owned-resource cleanup part of the canonical closeout operation",
        "item_id": "bossmode-4-durable-team-closeout",
        "why": "That leaves normal successful runs with resource debt"
      },
      {
        "dont": "Mark a team closed while an owned resource is orphaned or waiting for evidence",
        "instead": "Keep closeout in waiting_user and report the exact blocker",
        "item_id": "bossmode-4-durable-team-closeout",
        "why": "That hides unfinished cleanup"
      }
    ],
